# Build-context exclusions for the kaniko image build (Dockerfile).
#
# Do NOT list `deploy` here: the Dockerfile test stage runs
# tests/unit/test_single_replica.py, which scans deploy/k8s/ for Deployment
# manifests and fails the build when the tree is absent from the context
# (0.2.18-0.2.19 never published for exactly that reason).
.git
.gitignore
.venv
.marathon
.beads
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
